     1,
     "The plyr package seems awesome and really useful!<br><br>I&#39;m forwarding a great manuscript about &#39;tidy data&#39; and several uses for the plyr package incase anyone wants to read it before hand. I thought it was a nice, quick read with an overview of why and how to use these functions.<br>\r\n\r\n<br>Anna<br><br><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
